{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Ensembles\/documentation\/Ensembles\/CoreData\/NSManagedObjectContext\/isEnsemblesIntegrationContext"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isEnsemblesIntegrationContext","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Core Data calls "},{"code":"awakeFromInsert()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (and "},{"code":"awakeFromFetch()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") on objects that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Ensembles creates in this context, exactly as it does for objects your own code","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"inserts. If your "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"awakeFromInsert()"},{"type":"text","text":" assigns default values — a fresh "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UUID"},{"type":"text","text":", the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"current location, a timestamp — those assignments will run during integration and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can overwrite the synced values arriving from another device.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Guard such side effects so they only run for objects your app creates:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["override func awakeFromInsert() {","    super.awakeFromInsert()","    guard managedObjectContext?.isEnsemblesIntegrationContext != true else { return }","    if uniqueIdentifier == nil { uniqueIdentifier = UUID().uuidString }","    \/\/ ... ot